  "_comment": "Replay fixture version guard (#3911): scripts/check_replay_fixture_versions.py. Each replayable game names its engine_version constant, the fixtures pinned under each version, and the tests that hard-code replay results. 'expectations' is a chosen subset of tests whose hand-written values pin replay results; the fixture pin is the main protection. Every file under 'scan' must be a game's fixture or listed in 'not_replay'. How to run, what it checks and how to override: docs/CI-CHECKS.md#replay-fixture-version-guard-3911.",
